        ]
      ],
      "english": "Questions of existence occur naturally throughout mathematics. The question of whether a solution exists \\emph{should pop into} a mathematician's head any time he or she writes an equation down. Appropriately, the problem of existence of solutions of partial differential equations occupies a large portion of this text. In this section we consider precursors of the PDE theorems to come.",
      "chinese": "存在性问题自然地贯穿于整个数学之中. 数学家每次写下一个方程时, 脑海中\\emph{都应当浮现}这个方程是否有解的问题. 因而, 偏微分方程解的存在性问题在本书中占有很大的篇幅, 这是恰当的. 本节考察后面将要讨论的偏微分方程定理的一些先导结果.",
