    {
      "id": "ode-existence",
      "type": "theorem",
      "regions": [
        [
          12,
          95,
          713,
          1040,
          1255
        ]
      ],
      "english": "Let $D\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}\\times\\mathbb{R}^n$ be an open set, and let $\\bm{F}:D\\to\\mathbb{R}^n$ be continuous in its first variable and \\textbf{uniformly Lipschitz in its second}; i.e., for $(t,\\bm{y})\\in D$, $\\bm{F}(t,\\bm{y})$ is continuous as a function of $t$, and there exists a constant $\\gamma$ such that for any $(t,\\bm{y}_1)$ and $(t,\\bm{y}_2)$ in $D$ we have\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:uniform-lipschitz-bound}\n|\\bm{F}(t,\\bm{y}_1)-\\bm{F}(t,\\bm{y}_2)|\\leq\\gamma|\\bm{y}_1-\\bm{y}_2|.\n\\end{equation}\nThen, for any $(t_0,\\bm{y}_0)\\in D$, there exists an interval $I:=(t^-,t^+)$ containing $t_0$ and at least one solution $\\bm{y}\\in C^1(I)$ of the initial-value problem\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:ode-initial-value-dynamics}\n\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}\\bm{y}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(t)=\\bm{F}(t,\\bm{y}(t)),\n\\end{equation}\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:ode-initial-value-data}\n\\bm{y}(t_0)=\\bm{y}_0.\n\\end{equation}",
      "chinese": "设 $D\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}\\times\\mathbb{R}^n$ 为开集, 且 $\\bm{F}:D\\to\\mathbb{R}^n$ 关于第一个变量连续, \\textbf{关于第二个变量一致 Lipschitz 连续}; 即对于 $(t,\\bm{y})\\in D$, $\\bm{F}(t,\\bm{y})$ 作为 $t$ 的函数连续, 并且存在常数 $\\gamma$, 使得对于 $D$ 中任意的 $(t,\\bm{y}_1)$ 和 $(t,\\bm{y}_2)$ 都有\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:uniform-lipschitz-bound}\n|\\bm{F}(t,\\bm{y}_1)-\\bm{F}(t,\\bm{y}_2)|\\leq\\gamma|\\bm{y}_1-\\bm{y}_2|.\n\\end{equation}\n那么, 对于任意 $(t_0,\\bm{y}_0)\\in D$, 都存在包含 $t_0$ 的区间 $I:=(t^-,t^+)$, 使得初值问题\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:ode-initial-value-dynamics}\n\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}\\bm{y}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(t)=\\bm{F}(t,\\bm{y}(t)),\n\\end{equation}\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:ode-initial-value-data}\n\\bm{y}(t_0)=\\bm{y}_0.\n\\end{equation}\n至少有一个解 $\\bm{y}\\in C^1(I)$.",
      "label": "thm:ode-existence",
      "title_en": "ODE existence, Picard-Lindelöf",
      "title_zh": "常微分方程的存在性, Picard-Lindelöf",
      "source_locations": [
