    {
      "id": "equivalent-integral-equation",
      "type": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "regions": [
        [
          12,
          95,
          1282,
          1040,
          1545
        ]
      ],
      "english": "The proof of this can be found in almost any text on ODEs. We make note of one version of the proof that is the source of many techniques in PDEs: the construction of an equivalent integral equation. In this proof, one shows that there is a continuous function $\\bm{y}$ that satisfies\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:ode-integral-equation}\n\\bm{y}(t)=\\bm{y}_0+\\int_{t_0}^t\\bm{F}(s,\\bm{y}(s))\\,\\mathrm{d}s.\n\\end{equation}",
      "chinese": "几乎任何一本常微分方程教材中都能找到这一结果的证明. 我们要指出其中一种证明, 它是偏微分方程中许多技巧的来源: 构造一个等价的积分方程. 在这一证明中, 先证明存在连续函数 $\\bm{y}$ 满足\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:ode-integral-equation}\n\\bm{y}(t)=\\bm{y}_0+\\int_{t_0}^t\\bm{F}(s,\\bm{y}(s))\\,\\mathrm{d}s.\n\\end{equation}",
      "label": null,
      "title_en": null,
      "title_zh": null,
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 12,
