        ]
      ],
      "english": "The following theorems from advanced calculus give information on the solution of algebraic equations. The first, the inverse function theorem, considers the problem of $n$ equations in $n$ unknowns.",
      "chinese": "下面这些高等微积分中的定理给出了代数方程解的有关信息. 第一个定理是反函数定理, 它考察由 $n$ 个方程和 $n$ 个未知量构成的问题.",
