    {
      "id": "inverse-function",
      "type": "theorem",
      "regions": [
        [
          13,
          90,
          799,
          1040,
          1407
        ]
      ],
      "english": "Suppose the function\n\\[\n\\bm{F}:\\mathbb{R}^n\\ni\\bm{x}:=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\mapsto\\bm{F}(\\bm{x}):=(F_1(\\bm{x}),\\ldots,F_n(\\bm{x}))\\in\\mathbb{R}^n\n\\]\nis $C^1$ in a neighborhood of a point $\\bm{x}_0$. Further assume that\n\\[\n\\bm{F}(\\bm{x}_0)=\\bm{p}_0\n\\]\nand\n\\[\n\\dfrac{\\partial\\bm{F}}{\\partial\\bm{x}}(\\bm{x}_0):=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n\\dfrac{\\partial F_1}{\\partial x_1}(\\bm{x}_0)&\\cdots&\\dfrac{\\partial F_1}{\\partial x_n}(\\bm{x}_0)\\\\\n\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\\n\\dfrac{\\partial F_n}{\\partial x_1}(\\bm{x}_0)&\\cdots&\\dfrac{\\partial F_n}{\\partial x_n}(\\bm{x}_0)\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\]\nis nonsingular. Then there is a neighborhood $N_x$ of $\\bm{x}_0$ and a neighborhood $N_p$ of $\\bm{p}_0$ such that $\\bm{F}:N_x\\to N_p$ is one-to-one and onto; i.e., for every $\\bm{p}\\in N_p$ the equation\n\\[\n\\bm{F}(\\bm{x})=\\bm{p}\n\\]\nhas a unique solution in $N_x$.",
      "chinese": "设函数\n\\[\n\\bm{F}:\\mathbb{R}^n\\ni\\bm{x}:=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\mapsto\\bm{F}(\\bm{x}):=(F_1(\\bm{x}),\\ldots,F_n(\\bm{x}))\\in\\mathbb{R}^n\n\\]\n在点 $\\bm{x}_0$ 的某个邻域内为 $C^1$ 的. 进一步假设\n\\[\n\\bm{F}(\\bm{x}_0)=\\bm{p}_0\n\\]\n且\n\\[\n\\dfrac{\\partial\\bm{F}}{\\partial\\bm{x}}(\\bm{x}_0):=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n\\dfrac{\\partial F_1}{\\partial x_1}(\\bm{x}_0)&\\cdots&\\dfrac{\\partial F_1}{\\partial x_n}(\\bm{x}_0)\\\\\n\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\\n\\dfrac{\\partial F_n}{\\partial x_1}(\\bm{x}_0)&\\cdots&\\dfrac{\\partial F_n}{\\partial x_n}(\\bm{x}_0)\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\]\n非奇异. 那么, 存在 $\\bm{x}_0$ 的邻域 $N_x$ 和 $\\bm{p}_0$ 的邻域 $N_p$, 使得 $\\bm{F}:N_x\\to N_p$ 为一一映射且为满射; 即对于每个 $\\bm{p}\\in N_p$, 方程\n\\[\n\\bm{F}(\\bm{x})=\\bm{p}\n\\]\n在 $N_x$ 中有唯一解.",
      "label": "thm:inverse-function",
      "title_en": "Inverse function theorem",
      "title_zh": "反函数定理",
