      "english": "Our second result, the implicit function theorem, concerns solving a system of $p$ equations in $q+p$ unknowns.",
      "chinese": "第二个结果是隐函数定理, 它涉及求解由 $p$ 个方程和 $q+p$ 个未知量构成的方程组.",
