    {
      "id": "implicit-function",
      "type": "theorem",
      "regions": [
        [
          13,
          90,
          1500,
          1040,
          1710
        ],
        [
          14,
          95,
          163,
          1045,
          608
        ]
      ],
      "english": "Suppose the function\n\\[\n\\bm{F}:\\mathbb{R}^q\\times\\mathbb{R}^p\\ni(\\bm{x},\\bm{y})\\mapsto\\bm{F}(\\bm{x},\\bm{y})\\in\\mathbb{R}^p\n\\]\nis $C^1$ in a neighborhood of a point $(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)$. Further assume that\n\\[\n\\bm{F}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)=0,\n\\]\nand that the $p\\times p$ matrix\n\\[\n\\dfrac{\\partial\\bm{F}}{\\partial\\bm{y}}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0):=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n\\dfrac{\\partial F_1}{\\partial y_1}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)&\\cdots&\\dfrac{\\partial F_1}{\\partial y_p}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)\\\\\n\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\\n\\dfrac{\\partial F_p}{\\partial y_1}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)&\\cdots&\\dfrac{\\partial F_p}{\\partial y_p}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\]\nis nonsingular. Then there is a neighborhood $N_x\\subset\\mathbb{R}^q$ of $\\bm{x}_0$ and a function $\\hat{\\bm{y}}:N_x\\to\\mathbb{R}^p$ such that\n\\[\n\\hat{\\bm{y}}(\\bm{x}_0)=\\bm{y}_0,\n\\]\nand for every $\\bm{x}\\in N_x$\n\\[\n\\bm{F}(\\bm{x},\\hat{\\bm{y}}(\\bm{x}))=0.\n\\]",
      "chinese": "设函数\n\\[\n\\bm{F}:\\mathbb{R}^q\\times\\mathbb{R}^p\\ni(\\bm{x},\\bm{y})\\mapsto\\bm{F}(\\bm{x},\\bm{y})\\in\\mathbb{R}^p\n\\]\n在点 $(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)$ 的某个邻域内为 $C^1$ 的. 进一步假设\n\\[\n\\bm{F}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)=0,\n\\]\n且 $p\\times p$ 矩阵\n\\[\n\\dfrac{\\partial\\bm{F}}{\\partial\\bm{y}}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0):=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n\\dfrac{\\partial F_1}{\\partial y_1}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)&\\cdots&\\dfrac{\\partial F_1}{\\partial y_p}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)\\\\\n\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\\n\\dfrac{\\partial F_p}{\\partial y_1}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)&\\cdots&\\dfrac{\\partial F_p}{\\partial y_p}(\\bm{x}_0,\\bm{y}_0)\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\]\n非奇异. 那么, 存在 $\\bm{x}_0$ 的邻域 $N_x\\subset\\mathbb{R}^q$ 及函数 $\\hat{\\bm{y}}:N_x\\to\\mathbb{R}^p$, 使得\n\\[\n\\hat{\\bm{y}}(\\bm{x}_0)=\\bm{y}_0,\n\\]\n且对于每个 $\\bm{x}\\in N_x$ 都有\n\\[\n\\bm{F}(\\bm{x},\\hat{\\bm{y}}(\\bm{x}))=0.\n\\]",
      "label": "thm:implicit-function",
      "title_en": "Implicit function theorem",
      "title_zh": "隐函数定理",
